All 15 tests pass. The bugs I fixed:

- `src/auth.py:6` — `has_permission` now compares roles case-insensitively.
- `src/auth.py:13` — `is_admin_or_owner` now uses `or` instead of `and`.
- `src/inventory.py:13` — `Inventory.__init__` avoids a mutable default argument and copies the initial dict.
- `src/inventory.py:20` — `add` now accumulates stock instead of replacing it.
- `src/inventory.py:28` — `reserve` allows reserving exactly the available amount (`>` instead of `>=`).
- `src/inventory.py:35` — `release` raises `ValueError` when releasing more than was reserved.
- `src/text_utils.py:16` — `slugify` lowercases alphanumeric characters and collapses repeated separators with a regex.
- `src/text_utils.py:33` — `truncate` now accounts for the suffix length in the cutoff.
